<title>JAPAN: Superbag -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Superbag -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.48		vs	   17.97</p>
